#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:2
msgid "How to create vCloud Director templates for Morpheus"
msgstr "How to create vCloud Director templates para Morpheus"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:5
msgid "To create a Windows Template"
msgstr "To create un Windows Template"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:7
msgid ""
"Create a new machine in VMware vCenter and install a base version of your"
" preferred Windows build."
msgstr ""
"Create un nuevo machine in VMware vCenter y install un base versión of "
"your preferred Windows build."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:9
msgid "Apply any service packs / updates to the operating system."
msgstr "Apply cualquier servicio packs / updates to el operating sistema."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:10
msgid ""
"Set the Network location to Private the below PowerShell will set the "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Establezca el Network location to Private el a continuación PowerShell "
"será set el location."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:12
msgid ""
"Get-NetConnectionProfile | Set-NetconnectionProfile -NetworkCategory "
"private"
msgstr ""
"Get-NetConnectionProfile | Set-NetconnectionProfile -NetworkCategory "
"privado"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:16
msgid "Configure WinRM to allow remote management and open the firewall."
msgstr "Configure WinRM to allow remoto management y open el firewall."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:18
msgid ""
"To do this, under local computer Administrator, open a command prompt and"
" run ``winrm quickconfig``"
msgstr ""
"To do este, under local computer Administrator, open un command prompt y "
"run ``winrm quickconfig``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:20
msgid "Install VMware tools"
msgstr "Install VMware tools"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:21
msgid "Install .Net at least 4.5"
msgstr "Install .Net at least 4.5"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:22
msgid "Enable remote PowerShell this can be done in PowerShell."
msgstr "Enable remoto PowerShell este puede be done in PowerShell."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:24
msgid "Enable-PSremoting"
msgstr "Enable-PSremoting"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:28
msgid "Shutdown the virtual machine and convert to a template."
msgstr "Shutdown el virtual machine y convert to un template."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:30
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:81
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:30
msgid "Do not run sysprep"
msgstr "Do no run sysprep"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:34
msgid "To create a Linux Centos template"
msgstr "To create un Linux Centos template"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:36
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:50
msgid ""
"Create a new machine in VMware vCenter and install a base version of your"
" preferred Linux distro build. If you are using cloud init as part of "
"your image you will need to ensure your virtual machine has a cdrom."
msgstr ""
"Create un nuevo machine in VMware vCenter y install un base versión of "
"your preferred Linux distro build. If you son using cloud init as part of"
" your image you será need to ensure your virtual machine tiene un cdrom."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:38
msgid ""
"Before installing the operating system setup a single ``ext`` or ``xfs`` "
"partition without a swap disk (This is so that growpart can extend the "
"disk. growpart currently does not support lvm)"
msgstr ""
"Before installing el operating sistema setup un único ``ext`` o ``xfs`` "
"partition sin un swap disk (This es so que growpart puede extend el disk."
" growpart actualmente no soporta lvm)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:39
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:53
msgid ""
"Install the distro and apply any updates to the operating system and "
"security updates"
msgstr ""
"Install el distro y apply cualquier updates to el operating sistema y "
"security updates"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:40
msgid "Install cloud-init using command ``yum install cloud-init``"
msgstr "Install cloud-init using command ``yum install cloud-init``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:41
msgid ""
"Install cloud-utils-growpart using command ``yum install cloud-utils-"
"growpart``"
msgstr ""
"Install cloud-utils-growpart using command ``yum install cloud-utils-"
"growpart``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:42
msgid "Install vmware tools"
msgstr "Install vmware tools"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:43
msgid "Install git by running ``yum install git``"
msgstr "Install git by running ``yum install git``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:44
msgid "epel-release"
msgstr "epel-release"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:45
msgid "selinux set to permissive (enforced can cause problems with cloud-init)"
msgstr "selinux set to permissive (enforced puede cause problems con cloud-init)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:48
msgid "To create a Linux Ubuntu template"
msgstr "To create un Linux Ubuntu template"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:52
msgid ""
"Before installing the operating system setup a single ``ext`` partition "
"without a swap disk (This is so that growpart can extend the disk. "
"growpart currently does not support lvm)"
msgstr ""
"Before installing el operating sistema setup un único ``ext`` partition "
"sin un swap disk (This es so que growpart puede extend el disk. growpart "
"actualmente no soporta lvm)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:54
msgid "Ensure you have set a root password"
msgstr "Ensure you tienen set un root contraseña"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:55
msgid "Install cloud-init by running ``sudo apt install cloud-init``"
msgstr "Install cloud-init by running ``sudo apt install cloud-init``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:56
msgid "Install cloud-utils-growpart ``sudo apt install cloud-utils``"
msgstr "Install cloud-utils-growpart ``sudo apt install cloud-utils``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:57
msgid "Install desired hypervisor drivers (Virto, Open-VM Tools)"
msgstr "Install desired hypervisor drivers (Virto, Open-VM Tools)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:58
msgid "Install git by running ``sudo apt install git``"
msgstr "Install git by running ``sudo apt install git``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:59
msgid ""
"As Debian 9 includes network manager ensure this is disabled. Change the "
"below file"
msgstr ""
"As Debian 9 includes network manager ensure este es deshabilitado. Change"
" el a continuación archivo"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:61
msgid "/etc/NetworkManager/NetworkManager.conf"
msgstr "/etc/NetworkManager/NetworkManager.conf"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:65
msgid "to the following:"
msgstr "to el following:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:67
msgid "managed=false"
msgstr "managed=false"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:73
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We also recommend disabling network manager and setting the network "
"adapter to eth0 rather than the automatically assigned name. See a more "
"detailed guide on VMware image prep `here "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/vmware_templates.html?highlight=vmware%20image%20prep#creating-a"
"-centos-rhel-7-image>`_."
msgstr ""
"We también recommend disabling network manager y setting la red adapter "
"to eth0 rather than el automáticamente assigned nombre. See un más "
"detailed guía on VMware image prep `here "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/vmware_templates.html?highlight=vmware%20image%20prep#creating-a"
"-centos-rhel-7-image>`_."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:75
msgid ""
"To import your template into vCloud director you will need to login as "
"either an administrator or organisation administrator."
msgstr ""
"To import your template en vCloud director you será need to login as "
"either un administrator o organisation administrator."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:77
msgid ""
"Once logged into vCloud director you will then need select ``Manage "
"Organizations`` and then select your organization."
msgstr ""
"Once logged en vCloud director you será entonces need select ``Manage "
"Organizations`` y entonces select your organization."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:79
msgid ""
"From within the organisation click on ``Catalogues`` > select an existing"
" catalogue or create a new catalogue."
msgstr ""
"From dentro de el organisation click on ``Catalogues`` > select un "
"existente catalogue o create un nuevo catalogue."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:82
msgid ""
"Please note once you connect |morpheus| to your vCD environment, it will "
"create a catalogue called Auto |morpheus|. This is a working catalogue "
"and is ignored by |morpheus| when searching for images, so any images in "
"the catalogue will not be synced into |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"Please nota once you connect |morpheus| to your vCD entorno, it será "
"create un catalogue called Auto |morpheus|. This es un working catalogue "
"y es ignored by |morpheus| cuando searching para images, so cualquier "
"images in el catalogue no be synced en |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:84
msgid ""
"Open the catalogue and select the import template from vCenter and then "
"browse the data stores for your templates. Select your template and the "
"type in a new name and description then check the copy template into "
"vCloud director."
msgstr ""
"Open el catalogue y select el import template desde vCenter y entonces "
"browse el datos stores para your templates. Select your template y el "
"tipo in un nuevo nombre y descripción entonces check el copy template en "
"vCloud director."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:86
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once you click ok the import process will begin. When the import has "
"completed the template will appear in |morpheus| within "
":menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images`"
msgstr ""
"Once you click ok el import proceso será begin. When el import tiene "
"completed el template será appear in |morpheus| dentro de |LibVir|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the image does not appear within the virtual images you may need to "
"use the filters to filter the virtual images by the vmware ( vmdk / ovf /"
" ova) type."
msgstr ""
"If el image no appear dentro de el virtual images you puede need to use "
"el filters to filter el virtual images by el vmware ( vmdk / ovf / ova) "
"tipo."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:90
msgid ""
"You may also need to refresh the cloud. To do this go to ``Infrastructure"
" > Clouds`` >       select the vCloud Director cloud > select Refresh."
msgstr ""
"You puede también need to refresh la nube. To do este go to "
"``Infrastructure > Clouds`` >       select el vCloud Director cloud > "
"select Refresh."

